    "code": "# tone.py\n# slider farkans ra be hertz midahad; buzzer rooye GPIO 4.\nfrom machine import Pin, ADC, PWM\nimport time\n\nknob = ADC(Pin(34))\nknob.atten(ADC.ATTN_11DB)\nbuzzer = PWM(Pin(4))\n\nhertz = round(knob.read() * 2000 / 4095)\nbuzzer.freq(hertz)\nbuzzer.duty(512)\nprint(hertz)\n\nwhile True:\n    time.sleep(0.2)\n",
